{
  "id": 8867179888839,
  "title": "Personalized Baseball Bedding Full Size Flag Custom Name D - Design 14",
  "handle": "personalized-baseball-bedding-full-size-flag-custom-name-d-design-14",
  "body_html": "<p>At Jeminise, we offer this comfortable and durable Comforter Set, perfect for baseball players, fans, and lovers. Show your determination with this unique bedding set, designed to add a sporty touch to any room.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Gift:</strong> A perfect gift for men and women, moms and dads, ideal for Valentine's, Mother's Day, Father's Day, and Christmas.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Comes in US Twin (68\" x 88\"), US Full (78\" x 88\"), US Queen (88\" x 88\"), and US King (104\" x 88\").</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Superior Manufacturing:</strong> Features an environmental protection finishing process that prevents fading, with smooth, fine, and compact stitching for lasting enjoyment.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Comfy Material:</strong> Made from 100% Brushed Polyester Fabric, offering a soft, comfy, durable, and lightweight feel.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Microfiber Filling:</strong> Includes whole-piece microfiber filling with tight stitching to prevent clumping or shifting.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water; air dry without heat. Microfiber dries quickly and becomes fluffier after washing.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Features a \"Baseball Thunder\" color and \"Baseball\" pattern, with options for 2 text inputs for personalization.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Duvet Cover Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester, Cotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Baseball Thunder</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Baseball</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Set Name</th>\n<td>Personalized Baseball Bedding Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>US Twin (68\" x 88\"), US Full (78\" x 88\"), US Queen (88\" x 88\"), US King (104\" x 88\")</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Breathable</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>2 text inputs</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
